{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29633","headline":"圣女祠 · 李商隐","name":"圣女祠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"杳蔼逢仙迹，苍茫滞客途。\n何年归碧落，此路向皇都。\n消息期青雀，逢迎异紫姑。\n肠回楚国梦，心断汉宫巫。\n从骑裁寒竹，行车荫白榆。\n星娥一去後，月姊更来无。\n寡鹄迷苍壑，羇凰怨翠梧。\n惟应碧桃下，方朔是狂夫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29633.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29633","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}